<title>SOUTH KOREA: Dae Han seeks 23,000T of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Dae Han seeks 23,000T of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dae Han Flour Mills Co Ltd invited on Thursday tenders for 23,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT), traders said.</p>
<p>They said shipment was set for January 5-February 5 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
